T* (type knife or possibly use a Dremel with a small grinding bit. Then make solder bridges on) Tj
T* (JP3 \(1-2\), JP4 \(1-2\) and JP5 \(1-2\) leaving JP2 open with no bridges at all. See below: \(These) Tj
